  "talents_description": {
    "modifier_aghanim_1_0": "The hero gains an Aura that reduces enemy Armor by 2/3/4 \n\n Radius: 900",
    "modifier_aghanim_1_1": "The hero gains an Aura that reduces enemy Armor by <b><font color='#eabe10'>2</font></b>/3/4 \n\n Radius: 900",
    "modifier_aghanim_1_2": "The hero gains an Aura that reduces enemy Armor by 2/<b><font color='#eabe10'>3</font></b>/4 \n\n Radius: 900",
    "modifier_aghanim_1_3": "The hero gains an Aura that reduces enemy Armor by 2/3/<b><font color='#eabe10'>4</font></b> \n\n Radius: 900",
    "modifier_aghanim_2_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Aghanim's Ray no longer deals increased damage at the enemy's health threshold.</font></b> \n\n Aghanim's Ray Damage Increase: 1%/2%/3% of Max Health",
    "modifier_aghanim_2_1": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Aghanim's Ray no longer deals increased damage at the enemy's health threshold.</font></b> \n\n Aghanim's Ray Damage Increase: <b><font color='#eabe10'>1%</font></b>/2%/3% of Max Health",
    "modifier_aghanim_2_2": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Aghanim's Ray no longer deals increased damage at the enemy's health threshold.</font></b> \n\n Aghanim's Ray Damage Increase: 1%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>2%</font></b>/3% of Max Health",
    "modifier_aghanim_2_3": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Aghanim's Ray no longer deals increased damage at the enemy's health threshold.</font></b> \n\n Aghanim's Ray Damage Increase: 1%/2%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>3%</font></b> of Max Health",
    "modifier_aghanim_3_0": "Shard Blast deals Physical Damage instead of Magical Damage. \n\n Shard Blast Mana Cost Reduction: 50% \n\n Additional Shard Blast Charges: 1",
    "modifier_aghanim_3_1": "Shard Blast deals <b><font color='#eabe10'>Physical</font></b> Damage instead of Magical Damage. \n\n Shard Blast Mana Cost Reduction: <b><font color='#eabe10'>50%</font></b> \n\n Additional Shard Blast Charges: <b><font color='#eabe10'>1</font></b>",
    "modifier_aghanim_4_0": "Aghanim's Ray no longer needs to be maintained and controlled. \n\n Aghanim's Ray procs on the nearest target within a radius: 450/600",
    "modifier_aghanim_4_1": "Aghanim's Ray <b><font color='#eabe10'>no longer needs</font></b> to be maintained and controlled. \n\n Aghanim's Ray procs on the nearest target within a radius: <b><font color='#eabe10'>450</font></b>/600",
    "modifier_aghanim_4_2": "Aghanim's Ray <b><font color='#eabe10'>no longer needs</font></b> to be maintained and controlled. \n\n Aghanim's Ray procs on the nearest target within a radius: 450/<b><font color='#eabe10'>600</font></b>",
    "modifier_aghanim_5_0": "Shard Blast Damage Increase: 2%/4%/6% of Max Health \n\n Shard Blast disables the target's passive abilities for: 0.5/1/1.5 sec.",
    "modifier_aghanim_5_1": "Shard Blast Damage Increase: <b><font color='#eabe10'>2%</font></b>/4%/6% of Max Health \n\n Shard Blast disables the target's passive abilities for: <b><font color='#eabe10'>0.5</font></b>/1/1.5 sec.",
    "modifier_aghanim_5_2": "Shard Blast Damage Increase: 2%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>4%</font></b>/6% of Max Health \n\n Shard Blast disables the target's passive abilities for: 0.5/<b><font color='#eabe10'>1</font></b>/1.5 sec.",
    "modifier_aghanim_5_3": "Shard Blast Damage Increase: 2%/4%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>6%</font></b> of Max Health \n\n Shard Blast disables the target's passive abilities for: 0.5/1/<b><font color='#eabe10'>1.5</font></b> sec.",
    "modifier_aghanim_6_0": "Aghanim's Ray becomes a Passive Ability. Disabled by break. \n\n Aghanim's Ray deals Physical Damage, not Magic.",
    "modifier_aghanim_6_1": "Aghanim's Ray becomes a <b><font color='#eabe10'>Passive Ability</font></b>. Disabled by break. \n\n Aghanim's Ray deals <b><font color='#eabe10'>Physical</font></b> Damage, not Magic.",
    "modifier_aghanim_7_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Water Bubble.</font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: Aghanim Blast \n\n Creates a powerful explosion around the hero that stuns enemies and casts Shard Blast on them. \n\n Stun Duration: 2.2 seconds \n Radius: 900 \n Cooldown: 18 seconds",
    "modifier_aghanim_7_1": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Water Bubble.</font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Aghanim Blast</font></b> \n\n Creates a powerful explosion around the hero that stuns enemies and casts <b><font color='#eabe10'>Shard Blast</font></b> on them. \n\n Stun Duration: <b><font color='#eabe10'>2.2</font></b> seconds \n Radius: 900 \n Cooldown: 18 seconds",
    "modifier_aghanim_8_0": "Projectile Speed: 150/300/450 \n\n Attack Speed: 10/20/30",
    "modifier_aghanim_8_1": "Projectile Speed: <b><font color='#eabe10'>150</font></b>/300/450 \n\n Attack Speed: <b><font color='#eabe10'>10</font></b>/20/30",
    "modifier_aghanim_8_2": "Projectile Speed: 150/<b><font color='#eabe10'>300</font></b>/450 \n\n Attack Speed: 10/<b><font color='#eabe10'>20</font></b>/30",
    "modifier_aghanim_8_3": "Projectile Speed: 150/300/<b><font color='#eabe10'>450</font></b> \n\n Attack Speed: 10/20/<b><font color='#eabe10'>30</font></b>",
    "modifier_aghanim_9_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Aghanim's Ray.</font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: Time Attack \n\n The hero attacks all enemies in the selected direction, which greatly slows down. \n\n Amount of Attacks: 1/2 \n Movement Slow: 30% \n Attack Slow: 50 \n Slow Duration: 3 seconds \n Cooldown: 9 seconds \n Cast Range: 800",
    "modifier_aghanim_9_1": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Aghanim's Ray.</font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Time Attack</font></b> \n\n The hero attacks all enemies in the selected direction, which greatly slows down. \n\n Amount of Attacks: <b><font color='#eabe10'>1</font></b>/2 \n Movement Slow: <b><font color='#eabe10'>30%</font></b> \n Attack Slow: <b><font color='#eabe10'>50</font></b> \n Slow Duration: 3 seconds \n Cooldown: 9 seconds \n Cast Range: 800",
    "modifier_aghanim_9_2": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Aghanim's Ray.</font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Time Attack</font></b> \n\n The hero attacks all enemies in the selected direction, which greatly slows down. \n\n Amount of Attacks: 1/<b><font color='#eabe10'>2</font></b> \n Movement Slow: <b><font color='#eabe10'>30%</font></b> \n Attack Slow: <b><font color='#eabe10'>50</font></b> \n Slow Duration: 3 seconds \n Cooldown: 9 seconds \n Cast Range: 800",
    "modifier_aghanim_10_0": "Continuum increases Attack Speed and Movement Speed: 25/50 \n\n Duration: 4 seconds",
    "modifier_aghanim_10_1": "Continuum increases Attack Speed and Movement Speed: <b><font color='#eabe10'>25</font></b>/50 \n\n Duration: 4 seconds",
    "modifier_aghanim_10_2": "Continuum increases Attack Speed and Movement Speed: 25/<b><font color='#eabe10'>50</font></b> \n\n Duration: 4 seconds",
    "modifier_aghanim_11_0": "Every 5th attack places a shield on the hero that absorbs any damage. \n\n Shield Durability: 50/100/150 \n Maximum Shield Durability: 600",
    "modifier_aghanim_11_1": "Every <b><font color='#eabe10'>5th</font></b> attack places a shield on the hero that absorbs any damage. \n\n Shield Durability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>50</font></b>/100/150 \n Maximum Shield Durability: 600",
    "modifier_aghanim_11_2": "Every <b><font color='#eabe10'>5th</font></b> attack places a shield on the hero that absorbs any damage. \n\n Shield Durability: 50/<b><font color='#eabe10'>100</font></b>/150 \n Maximum Shield Durability: 600",
    "modifier_aghanim_11_3": "Every <b><font color='#eabe10'>5th</font></b> attack places a shield on the hero that absorbs any damage. \n\n Shield Durability: 50/100/<b><font color='#eabe10'>150</font></b> \n Maximum Shield Durability: 600",
    "modifier_aghanim_12_0": "Continuum Cooldown Reduction: 2/4 seconds \n\n Strength: 10/20",
    "modifier_aghanim_12_1": "Continuum Cooldown Reduction: <b><font color='#eabe10'>2</font></b>/4 seconds \n\n Strength: <b><font color='#eabe10'>10</font></b>/20",
    "modifier_aghanim_12_2": "Continuum Cooldown Reduction: 2/<b><font color='#eabe10'>4</font></b> seconds \n\n Strength: 10/<b><font color='#eabe10'>20</font></b>",
    "modifier_aghanim_13_0": "Continuum can be pressed again within 2 seconds to return to the previous position. \n\n Agility: 20",
    "modifier_aghanim_13_1": "Continuum can be pressed again within <b><font color='#eabe10'>2</font></b> econds to return to the previous position. \n\n Agility: <b><font color='#eabe10'>20</font></b>",
    "modifier_aghanim_14_0": "Each attack steals 2.5% Movement Speed and 5 Attack Speed from the enemy. \n\n Duration: 3 seconds",
    "modifier_aghanim_14_1": "Each attack steals <b><font color='#eabe10'>2.5%</font></b> Movement Speed and <b><font color='#eabe10'>5</font></b> Attack Speed from the enemy. \n\n Duration: 3 seconds",
    "modifier_aghanim_15_0": "Aghanim's Ray Cooldown Reduction: 3/6 seconds \n\n Intellect: 3/6",
    "modifier_aghanim_15_1": "Aghanim's Ray Cooldown Reduction: <b><font color='#eabe10'>3</font></b>/6 seconds \n\n Intellect: <b><font color='#eabe10'>3</font></b>/6",
    "modifier_aghanim_15_2": "Aghanim's Ray Cooldown Reduction: 3/<b><font color='#eabe10'>6</font></b> seconds \n\n Intellect: 3/<b><font color='#eabe10'>6</font></b>",
    "modifier_aghanim_16_0": "While using Aghanim's Ray, any negative effect from enemy spells has no effect. \n\n Duration: 5 seconds",
    "modifier_aghanim_16_1": "While using Aghanim's Ray, any <b><font color='#eabe10'>negative effect</font></b> from enemy spells has no effect. \n\n Duration: <b><font color='#eabe10'>5</font></b> seconds",
    "modifier_aghanim_17_0": "Increase Aghanim's Ray Control Speed: 400/600",
    "modifier_aghanim_17_1": "Increase Aghanim's Ray Control Speed: <b><font color='#eabe10'>400</font></b>/600",
    "modifier_aghanim_17_2": "Increase Aghanim's Ray Control Speed: 400/<b><font color='#eabe10'>600</font></b>",
    "modifier_aghanim_18_0": "Water Bubble can be used on yourself. The hero will receive less damage, and will be healed at the end. \n\n Water Bubble Damage Reduction: 33%/66%/99% \n Healing: 100% of Ability Damage",
    "modifier_aghanim_18_1": "Water Bubble can be used on yourself. The hero will receive less damage, and will be healed at the end. \n\n Water Bubble Damage Reduction: <b><font color='#eabe10'>33%</font></b>/66%/99% \n Healing: <b><font color='#eabe10'>100%</font></b> of Ability Damage",
    "modifier_aghanim_18_2": "Water Bubble can be used on yourself. The hero will receive less damage, and will be healed at the end. \n\n Water Bubble Damage Reduction: 33%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>66%</font></b>/99% \n Healing: <b><font color='#eabe10'>100%</font></b> of Ability Damage",
    "modifier_aghanim_18_3": "Water Bubble can be used on yourself. The hero will receive less damage, and will be healed at the end. \n\n Water Bubble Damage Reduction: 33%/66%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>99%</font></b> \n Healing: <b><font color='#eabe10'>100%</font></b> of Ability Damage",
    "modifier_aghanim_19_0": "Increase Aghanim's Ray Health Threshold: 25%/50%",
    "modifier_aghanim_19_1": "Increase Aghanim's Ray Health Threshold: <b><font color='#eabe10'>25%</font></b>/50%",
    "modifier_aghanim_19_2": "Increase Aghanim's Ray Health Threshold: 25%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>50%</font></b>",
    "modifier_aghanim_20_0": "Increase Aghanim's Ray Damage: 40%/80% of Intellect",
    "modifier_aghanim_20_1": "Increase Aghanim's Ray Damage: <b><font color='#eabe10'>40%</font></b>/80% of Intellect",
    "modifier_aghanim_20_2": "Increase Aghanim's Ray Damage: 40%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>80%</font></b> of Intellect",
    "modifier_aghanim_21_0": "Using Items and other Abilities does not interrupt Aghanim's Ray. \n\n Channeling Aghanim's Ray grants an effect that increases Spell Damage every 0.5 seconds: 4% \n\n The effect lasts 0/3 seconds after Aghanim's Ray ends. \n\n Maximum Effects: 12",
    "modifier_aghanim_21_1": "Using Items and other Abilities <b><font color='#eabe10'>do not interrupt</font></b> Aghanim's Ray. \n\n Channeling Aghanim's Ray grants an effect that increases Spell Damage every 0.5 seconds: <b><font color='#eabe10'>4%</font></b> \n\n The effect lasts <b><font color='#eabe10'>0</font></b>/3 seconds after Aghanim's Ray ends. \n\n Maximum Effects: <b><font color='#eabe10'>12</font></b>",
    "modifier_aghanim_21_2": "Using Items and other Abilities <b><font color='#eabe10'>do not interrupt</font></b> Aghanim's Ray. \n\n Channeling Aghanim's Ray grants an effect that increases Spell Damage every 0.5 seconds: <b><font color='#eabe10'>4%</font></b> \n\n The effect lasts 0/<b><font color='#eabe10'>3</font></b> seconds after Aghanim's Ray ends. \n\n Maximum Effects: <b><font color='#eabe10'>12</font></b>"
  },
